<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">SAVED</text>
    <text class="hero-title">我的收藏</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">在学习记录里给课点「收藏」，就会出现在这里。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{empty}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="tag" size="48" color="#999999"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    还没有收藏。打开学习记录，给正在跟的课标一颗星。
  </view>
  <view
    class="card"
    wx:for="{{list}}"
    wx:key="lessonCode"
    data-code="{{item.lessonCode}}"
    data-title="{{item.topicTitle}}"
    bindtap="onOpen"
  >
    <text class="muted">{{item.lessonCode}}</text>
    <view class="title">{{item.topicTitle}}</view>
    <view class="muted" data-code="{{item.lessonCode}}" data-title="{{item.topicTitle}}" catchtap="onRemove">取消收藏</view>
  </view>
</view>
